{"id":"n18786-1-7","stage":4,"title":"고온 · 高温","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18786-1-7-1","ko":"동남아시아의 기후는 어때요?","zh":"东南亚的气候怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동남아시아의","meaning":"东南亚","explanation":"동남아시아：东南亚；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"동남아시아의","audio":"/audio/949052ca7de252e4bb25.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동남아시아의","audio":"/audio/949052ca7de252e4bb25.mp3"}},{"text":"기후는","meaning":"气候","explanation":"기후：气候；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"기후","audio":"/audio/46dcd2d4edb1381521d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32535","senseId":"2","lemma":"기후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기후는","audio":"/audio/566aee8a527ce5f17d4e.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"46dcd2d4edb13815","term":"기후","zh":"气候","audio":"/audio/46dcd2d4edb1381521d5.mp3","entryId":"32535","definition":"一定地区里多年表现出来的平均天气。","pronunciation":["기후"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b4687c018bb7f6c900a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18786-1-7-2","ko":"우리나라보다 고온의 날씨에 습도가 높아.","zh":"那里的气温比我们国家高，湿度也更大。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라보다","meaning":"我们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们；나라：国，国家；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라보다","audio":"/audio/8a68c4cedccd9b0dc359.mp3"}},{"text":"고온의","meaning":"高温","explanation":"고온：高温；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"고온","audio":"/audio/f35d81fc687c020b16e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18786","senseId":"1","lemma":"고온","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고온의","audio":"/audio/268d80c50f3f76093f3a.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨에","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨에","audio":"/audio/4f31534b238f378d4231.mp3"}},{"text":"습도가","meaning":"湿度","explanation":"습도：湿度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"습도","audio":"/audio/6a39dc792dabc09c1098.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83455","senseId":"1","lemma":"습도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"습도가","audio":"/audio/541e0a3fb9a5e21bcf4f.mp3"}},{"text":"높아.","meaning":"高，大","explanation":"높다：高，大；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"3","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"높아","audio":"/audio/787d672cda7ed8ce07e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"f35d81fc687c020b","term":"고온","zh":"高温","audio":"/audio/f35d81fc687c020b16e6.mp3","entryId":"18786","definition":"很高的温度。","pronunciation":["고온"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在